   "narration_text": "Your turn. Paste this: you want to build a Claude Cowork task packet — a structured brief that gives Claude exactly what it needs to complete a task without scope creep. Ask Claude to show you the five fields, what goes in each one, and how the packet prevents the two most common failure modes: Claude doing too much or doing the wrong thing.",
